  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Munich University of Digital Technologies and Applied Sciences (MUDT) is an exciting place to study. Located in the heart of Munich, Germany, it’s a modern university that blends cutting-edge tech with hands-on learning. MUDT offers a variety of courses in Digital Engineering, Applied Sciences, Business Informatics, and Technology.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Life at MUDT is multicultural. With international students from several countries, you’ll be surrounded by a global community. Plus, the university has support services, including career counselling, academic help, and more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>MUDT partners with REVO Munich to offer you exclusive accommodation just minutes away from the campus. You’ll get fully furnished studio rooms and shared rooms with all the necessary amenities and security.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
